message: "If you use this software, please cite the GRTRANS papers and this repository."
title: grtrans-rs
abstract: >-
  Rust port of GRTRANS, a general relativistic, polarized radiative transfer
  code for ray tracing emission from accretion flows and jets around spinning
  black holes.
authors:
